#: src/main.glade:122
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks "
"to the camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps ("
"or in daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to kee"
"p unlocking reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Se sèlman yon modèl figi ki enskri. Ekleraj chanje fason figi ou gade "
"nan kamera a, kidonk yon sèl modèl ka echwe nan aswè a anba lanp (oswa"
" nan lajounen). Ajoute yon dezyèm modèl ki anrejistre nan diferan limy"
"è pou kenbe déblotché serye nenpòt ki lè nan jounen an."

