#: src/onboarding.glade:68
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Enstalasyon fini!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:87
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing any"
"thing you would normally have to type your password for to authenticat"
"e, like running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unloc"
"k, your login keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically o"
"n login.\n\nYou can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to cha"
"nge more advanced settings or add additional models. Press Finish belo"
"w to close this window and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Nou fini! Ubuntu Hello aktif kounye a sou òdinatè sa a. Eseye fè nenpò"
"t bagay ou ta dwe nòmalman tape modpas ou pou otantifye, tankou kouri "
"yon lòd ak sudo. Si ou te aktive keyring oto-debloke, kle login ou osw"
"a KWallet pral debloke tou otomatikman lè w konekte.\n\nOu ka louvri U"
"buntu Hello Configurator pita pou chanje paramèt ki pi avanse oswa ajo"
"ute modèl adisyonèl. Peze Fini anba a pou fèmen fenèt sa a epi ouvri U"
"buntu Hello Configurator la."

#: src/onboarding.glade:135
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet us"
"ing face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello ka déblotché otomatikman keyring ou oswa KWallet lè l sèv"
"i avèk otantifikasyon figi, pou anpeche modpas envit apre ou fin konek"
"te."

#: src/onboarding.glade:147
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Pèmèt kle otomatik/KWallet déblotché"

#: src/onboarding.glade:189
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Konfime modpas"

#: src/onboarding.glade:221
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Mete yon politik sètitid"

#: src/onboarding.glade:240
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match"
" is never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you "
"can set how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Akòz chanjman nan ang, distans, ak lòt faktè yon match figi pa janm eg"
"zakteman menm jan ak modèl figi ki estoke. Nan paj sa a ou ka fikse ki"
" jan strik Ubuntu Hello ta dwe."

#: src/onboarding.glade:279
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Vit"

#: src/onboarding.glade:295
msgid ""
"Allows more fuzzy matches, \nbut speeds up the scanning process greatl"
"y."
msgstr ""
"Pèmèt plis alimèt flou, \nmen akselere pwosesis optik la anpil."

#: src/onboarding.glade:334
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Ekilibre"

#: src/onboarding.glade:350
msgid ""
"Still relatively quick detection, \nbut might not log you in when furt"
"her away."
msgstr ""
"Deteksyon toujou relativman rapid, \nmen ta ka pa konekte ou lè pi lwe"
"n."

#: src/onboarding.glade:389
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Sekirize"

#: src/onboarding.glade:405
msgid ""
"The slightly safer option, \nbut will take much longer to authenticate"
" you"
msgstr ""
